<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; padding: 32px; margin: 0;">
  <table style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <h1 style="color: #dc2626; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">⚠️ SIP Premium Missed</h1>
          <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; margin: 0;">SIP For Child — Payment Overdue</p>
        </div>

        <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 15px;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
        <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
          Your SIP premium for <strong>Month {{missedMonth}}</strong> was due on <strong>{{dueDate}}</strong> but has not been received.
        </p>

        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0; border: 1px solid #fca5a5;">
          <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 14px;">
            <tr>
              <td style="color: #6b7280; padding-bottom: 8px;">Plan</td>
              <td style="color: #111827; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; padding-bottom: 8px;">{{planName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="color: #6b7280; padding-bottom: 8px;">Missed Month</td>
              <td style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; padding-bottom: 8px;">Month {{missedMonth}} of {{totalMonths}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="color: #6b7280; padding-bottom: 8px;">Due Date</td>
              <td style="color: #111827; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; padding-bottom: 8px;">{{dueDate}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="color: #6b7280; padding-bottom: 8px;">Monthly Premium</td>
              <td style="color: #111827; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; padding-bottom: 8px;">₹{{monthlyPremium}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="color: #6b7280; padding-bottom: 8px;">Months Missed</td>
              <td style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; padding-bottom: 8px;">{{monthsMissed}} of 3</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fefce8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #fde047;">
          <p style="color: #854d0e; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
            <strong>Important:</strong> After 3 missed payments, your SIP will be automatically rejected and a full refund of your paid premiums will be credited to your wallet. Pay now to keep your SIP active.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
          <a href="{{dashboardLink}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #dc2626; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 36px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px;">
            Pay Now
          </a>
        </p>

        <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;" />
        <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
          &copy; {{year}} Pennytor. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
